WEBVTT

1
00:00:01.500 --> 00:00:04.600
My child's first years

2
00:00:04.600 --> 00:00:08.300
tie me forever to Renașterii
Street, in Bucureștii Noi.

3
00:00:09.800 --> 00:00:12.700
I remember that one winter

4
00:00:12.700 --> 00:00:17.600
the snowdrifts were so deep that
we couldn't get out of the yard.

5
00:00:17.600 --> 00:00:21.600
We spent a whole day shovelling
to clear a path through the snow,

6
00:00:21.600 --> 00:00:26.100
and the next day I took my child
to nursery school on a sledge,

7
00:00:26.300 --> 00:00:32.400
and even to Bazilescu Park – quite
a way off, but still by sledge.

8
00:00:34.200 --> 00:00:37.600
These are memories that are
still alive in my heart

9
00:00:37.600 --> 00:00:41.000
and they will always tie
me to Renașterii Street,

10
00:00:41.000 --> 00:00:45.400
where my child's earliest
memories began to take shape.
